  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧ (transitive, to grill/burn). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{焼|や}ける (X burns/is grilled).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates resulting state. {焼|や}けている = 'is burnt' or 'has been grilled.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{肉|にく}→肉：02240_niku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{焼|や}ける (meat is grilled/done)\n- ⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{焼|や}ける (house burns down)\n- ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{焼|や}ける (get sunburned)\n- ⟦{焼|や}け{跡|あと}→焼け跡：27607_yakeato⟧ (burned remains)\n- ⟦{夕焼|ゆうや}け→夕焼け：05045_yuuyake⟧ (sunset glow)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {焼|や}ける (intransitive): X burns/is grilled\n- ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧ (transitive): burn/grill X\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{日焼|ひや}け→日焼け：15469_hiyake⟧ (sunburn, suntan—noun)\n- ⟦{朝焼|あさや}け→朝焼け：04655_asayake⟧ (morning glow)",
